SUMMARY:Context Is Everything: Building Agents That Know Your Work Context
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how Work IQ helps agents unde
 rstand the people\, projects\, and information that matter most in your or
 ganization.\n\nSee how richer context can make your agents more relevant\,
  grounded\, and effective in everyday work.\n\n---------------------------
 ----------------\n[**Copilot Developer Camp**](https://aka.ms/copilotdevca
 mp)\n📍 [Learn more about the series](https://developer.microsoft.com/re
 actor/series/S-1696/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27450_webpage_reactor)
