SUMMARY:CoreStory: Building with AI in Systems You Don’t Fully Understan
 d
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nMost organizations aren't building 
 on greenfield applications. They're building on decades of accumulated cod
 e\, integrations\, and undocumented business logic.\nAs AI becomes a core 
 part of software delivery\, teams face a new challenge: how do humans and 
 AI agents work effectively in systems nobody fully understands?\nThis sess
 ion explores the hidden costs of system ambiguity\, compares common approa
 ches to understanding legacy environments\, and discusses how organization
 s can create a persistent intelligence layer with CoreStory that enables s
 afer modernization\, faster onboarding\, and more confident AI-assisted de
 velopment.\nSeries Info - https://aka.ms/StartupSpotlight/S-1443\n[EventID
 :27461]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3157
 28543/
